==Skills and Abilities==
;Bite: A basic physical attack.
;Wing Thrash: Standing near a wing results in Joorahmaar swatting you with it, knocking you away, as well as sending out swirls of flames forward, indicated by circular AoEs.
;Sweeping Breath: Joorahmaar breathes fire in a half-circle pattern in the arena, indicated by long conical [[ON:AoE|AoE]].
;Unrelenting Force: Joorahmaar shouts facing forward, knocking you far away.
;Meteor Storm: Joorahmaar looks up then shouts, as a cloud of fiery energy appears above him, releasing a barrage of meteors down into the arena, indicated by circular AoEs.
;Summon Atronachs: At 70% health, Joorahmaar flies off and becomes untargettable. Weak [[ON:Flame Atronach|flame atronachs]] are then summoned into the arena, and will only come back to ground once they are defeated. He flies off again once he reaches 30% health, and this time summons a more powerful [[ON:Iron Atronach|iron atronach]]. As the iron atronach is summoned, Joorahmaar remains in the sky above the arena and breathes fire down into the center, covering a large section of the arena, which deals high constant damage.
;Flame Aura: As long as the dragon is grounded, a large ring of fire sits under him, dealing constant damage if standing inside.

==Notes==
* His name translates to ''"Mortal Hunter Terror"'' in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].
